    "name": "Sanguis: Veil of the Forgotten",
    "steam_appid": 2136910,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136910/extras/0ac3bd947c9d3300cf929ac87a28318c.poster.avif?t=1749655257\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136910/extras/0ac3bd947c9d3300cf929ac87a28318c.webm?t=1749655257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136910/extras/0ac3bd947c9d3300cf929ac87a28318c.mp4?t=1749655257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One night, your normal life is shattered when a friend leads you into the fog-covered woods, revealing a long-buried darkness. Drawn into a world of occult practices, ancient creatures, and supernatural forces, you must navigate a terrifying dungeon and uncover the truth behind the dark ritual.\u00a0The deeper you go, the more you realize you're not just a bystander - you\u2019re the main prey on tonight\u2019s menu.\u00a0Make choices that determine your fate\u00a0and uncover the truth behind the ancient rite before it\u2019s too late.\u00a0Will you escape the blood-stained curse, or become its next victim?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Experience a dynamic and visually rich narrative.</strong> Each moment and shift in the story is uniquely illustrated, immersing you in a world that responds to every action and change in emotion. Complementing this is a diverse musical score, reflecting every twist in the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136910/extras/0c0870b51ff40869b080b3cbb53548fa.poster.avif?t=1749655257\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136910/extras/0c0870b51ff40869b080b3cbb53548fa.webm?t=1749655257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136910/extras/0c0870b51ff40869b080b3cbb53548fa.mp4?t=1749655257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Make friends, confront enemies, and question the true intentions of those around you.</strong> Can you decipher their true motives and make the right choices to ensure your survival?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136910/extras/dfa90441856ac9d33ea174f212434a92.avif?t=1749655257\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Join our community on Discord</strong> to stay updated on the game's development and get access to exclusive content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136910/extras/3e0e1197abed65da36dcd3b16f875804.avif?t=1749655257\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Listen to some of the masterfully composed music for the novel.</strong> An orchestral score brings the game world to life with upbeat, optimistic tunes and ominous, foreboding compositions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136910/extras/add8990b3ae5b0c4a8bf79244956a7d3.avif?t=1749655257\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Keep checking back for updates and be ready to immerse yourself in &quot;Sanguis: Veil of the Forgotten&quot;. </strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136910/extras/0ac3bd947c9d3300cf929ac87a28318c.poster.avif?t=1749655257\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136910/extras/0ac3bd947c9d3300cf929ac87a28318c.webm?t=1749655257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136910/extras/0ac3bd947c9d3300cf929ac87a28318c.mp4?t=1749655257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One night, your normal life is shattered when a friend leads you into the fog-covered woods, revealing a long-buried darkness. Drawn into a world of occult practices, ancient creatures, and supernatural forces, you must navigate a terrifying dungeon and uncover the truth behind the dark ritual.\u00a0The deeper you go, the more you realize you're not just a bystander - you\u2019re the main prey on tonight\u2019s menu.\u00a0Make choices that determine your fate\u00a0and uncover the truth behind the ancient rite before it\u2019s too late.\u00a0Will you escape the blood-stained curse, or become its next victim?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Experience a dynamic and visually rich narrative.</strong> Each moment and shift in the story is uniquely illustrated, immersing you in a world that responds to every action and change in emotion. Complementing this is a diverse musical score, reflecting every twist in the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136910/extras/0c0870b51ff40869b080b3cbb53548fa.poster.avif?t=1749655257\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136910/extras/0c0870b51ff40869b080b3cbb53548fa.webm?t=1749655257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136910/extras/0c0870b51ff40869b080b3cbb53548fa.mp4?t=1749655257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Make friends, confront enemies, and question the true intentions of those around you.</strong> Can you decipher their true motives and make the right choices to ensure your survival?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136910/extras/dfa90441856ac9d33ea174f212434a92.avif?t=1749655257\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Join our community on Discord</strong> to stay updated on the game's development and get access to exclusive content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136910/extras/3e0e1197abed65da36dcd3b16f875804.avif?t=1749655257\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Listen to some of the masterfully composed music for the novel.</strong> An orchestral score brings the game world to life with upbeat, optimistic tunes and ominous, foreboding compositions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2136910/extras/add8990b3ae5b0c4a8bf79244956a7d3.avif?t=1749655257\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Keep checking back for updates and be ready to immerse yourself in &quot;Sanguis: Veil of the Forgotten&quot;. </strong></p>",
